# Plate back-face nodes (x = +42 mm) — clamped by /BCS/1 to mimic
# rigid back-side support (the only physical anchor available with
# the 1-hex plate Tier 1 syntax demo). Outer-rim clamping per
# ADR-024 (lite) is degenerate at this mesh density and is reserved
# for FM-04b.
/GRNOD/NODE/200
plate_back_face_nodes_for_clamp
        10        11        14        15
